        "The columnist argues that the market",
        "square should be free of cars."
      ],
      "audioText": "The columnist argues that the market square should be free of cars.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n7-b2-high-capstone-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-96.t02",
      "en": "Her thesis is clear from the start: the town centre belongs to people, not to traffic.",
      "es": "Su tesis está clara desde el principio: el centro del pueblo es de las personas, no del tráfico.",
      "explanationEs": "La tesis es la idea central; suele aparecer pronto y se repite al final.",
      "segments": [
        "Her thesis is clear from the start: the",
        "town centre belongs to people, not to traffic."
