    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-96.t03",
      "en": "She takes a clear stance, yet her tone stays calm and slightly ironic.",
      "es": "Adopta una postura clara, pero su tono sigue siendo tranquilo y algo irónico.",
      "explanationEs": "Stance es lo que defiende; tone, cómo lo dice. Pueden no coincidir.",
      "segments": [
        "She takes a clear stance, yet her",
        "tone stays calm and slightly ironic."
